  "_about": "Starter eval set. Relevance is a keyword proxy: a retrieved chunk counts as relevant if its text contains the 'expects' term(s). These labels are best-guesses for the recipe/nutrition CSVs and medical PDFs \u2014 REVIEW and refine them against your actual corpus so the numbers are meaningful. Use match_all:true to require every term.",
